sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Cluster Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant Operator as rhods-operator<br/>Controller
    participant CompCtrl as Component<br/>Controllers
    participant SvcCtrl as Service<br/>Controllers
    participant CloudMgr as Cloud Manager<br/>Controllers

    Note over Admin,CloudMgr: Platform Initialization Flow

    Admin->>K8sAPI: Create DSCInitialization CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Validate (DSCI v1/v2)<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response
    K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch event: DSCI created
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create GatewayConfig CR
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Auth CR
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Monitoring CR
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Namespaces<br/>Configure RBAC

    Note over Admin,CloudMgr: DataScienceCluster Lifecycle

    Admin->>K8sAPI: Create DataScienceCluster CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Mutate + Validate (DSC v1/v2)<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response (defaults applied)
    K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch event: DSC created
    Operator->>Operator: Parse component specs

    loop For each enabled component
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Create singleton Component CR<br/>(e.g., default-dashboard, default-kserve)
        K8sAPI->>CompCtrl: Watch event: Component CR created
        CompCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create owned resources<br/>(Deployments, Services, RBAC,<br/>NetworkPolicies, Routes)
    end

    Note over Admin,CloudMgr: Gateway & Authentication Chain

    SvcCtrl->>K8sAPI: Watch GatewayConfig changes
    SvcCtrl->>K8sAPI: Sync GatewaySpec to Dashboard CR
    SvcCtrl->>K8sAPI: Sync GatewayOIDCSpec to FeastOperator CR
    CompCtrl->>K8sAPI: Inject OAuthProxy sidecar<br/>into Kserve InferenceServices

    Note over Admin,CloudMgr: Multi-Cloud Infrastructure

    Admin->>K8sAPI: Create AWSKubernetesEngine CR
    K8sAPI->>CloudMgr: Watch event: Cloud engine CR
    CloudMgr->>K8sAPI: Manage cloud Kubernetes<br/>engine lifecycle

    Note over Admin,CloudMgr: Webhook Processing (Notebooks)

    Admin->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Notebook CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: /mutate-hardware-profile<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    Webhook->>K8sAPI: Read HardwareProfile CR
    K8sAPI-->>Webhook: HardwareProfile spec
    Webhook->>Webhook: Inject resource requirements
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated Notebook

    K8sAPI->>Webhook: /platform-connection-notebook<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    Webhook->>K8sAPI: Read Secrets (connection data)
    K8sAPI-->>Webhook: Secret values
    Webhook->>Webhook: Mount connection volumes
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated Notebook

    Note over Admin,CloudMgr: Health & Metrics

    K8sAPI->>Operator: GET /healthz (8081/HTTP)
    Operator-->>K8sAPI: 200 OK
    K8sAPI->>Operator: GET /readyz (8081/HTTP)
    Operator-->>K8sAPI: 200 OK
